WEBVTT

00:09:57.528 --> 00:10:00.693
and at a time of similar
high national debt.

00:10:01.134 --> 00:10:03.725
It's time to build another network,

00:10:03.749 --> 00:10:05.191
one for CO2.

00:10:05.646 --> 00:10:07.429
It does not need to last forever.

00:10:07.874 --> 00:10:11.828
It can be there just for the transition
away from fossil fuels.

00:10:12.294 --> 00:10:16.239
But we need it now to preserve
local manufacturing jobs

00:10:16.263 --> 00:10:17.556
and our communities

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:21.243
and provide a hope for a better
and more sustainable future.

00:10:22.158 --> 00:10:24.232
It is critical that governments,

00:10:24.256 --> 00:10:26.433
both local and national,

00:10:26.457 --> 00:10:27.934
as well as companies,

00:10:27.958 --> 00:10:31.459
assess the potential
for carbon capture at a local level,